    sideBLabelEn: 'Rational Termination (Sunk Cost Reset)',
    sideBDetailEn: '"The software architecture is fundamentally flawed. We cut our loss at ₹50 crores today and switch to an off-the-shelf solution."',
    researchSummaryEn: 'Barry M. Staw (1976) published "Knee-deep in the big muddy: A study of escalating commitment to a chosen course of action" in OBHP.',
    scenarioTitleEn: 'The Unviable Logistics App in Koramangala',
