    scenarioBreakdownEn: 'A textbook real-world case of Mental Accounting. Manish categorized his regular salary into the "bills & survival" bucket and his bonus into the "play money" bucket. Had he treated money as fungible, using the ₹50,000 to prepay the 16% loan would have delivered an instant risk-free return of ₹8,000.',
